{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100"],"summary":"The intake statement reports that Alice Chen is the registered holder of account ACC-100. This is an investigator record of what was reported at intake, without independent account-provider confirmation or a timestamp for when the statement was made.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-statement-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/statement/line-1"}]},{"timestamp_text":"2026-01-10 09:00 UTC","participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100","ACC-200","TX-1"],"summary":"Transaction record TX-1 reports a USD 500 transfer from ACC-100 to ACC-200 at 2026-01-10 09:00 UTC and names Alice Chen as the initiating user. The record identifies the source and destination accounts but does not establish the owner or controller of ACC-200.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100"],"summary":"An account-registry excerpt lists ACC-100 as active and repeats the display name Alice Chen. It does not show the underlying identity-verification result, the date of the last verification, or a provider signature, and should be treated as a source assertion rather than independent proof of ownership.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-account-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/account-registry/record-100"}]}]}